            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A print setting application that causes an information processing apparatus to perform a control method, the print setting application cooperating with IPP (Internet Print Protocol) class driver. The control method comprises accepting a setting for a print job to be outputted to an image forming apparatus from the information processing apparatus, and in a case where a setting requiring an operation by a user in the image forming apparatus is included in the accepted setting, causing a display unit to display information related to the operation after the information processing apparatus accepts a print instruction from the user.</p>
            </abstract>
